{"retrieved_on": "2026-11-13", "source_url": "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=%28EXT_ID%3A38343631+OR+EXT_ID%3A38347140+OR+EXT_ID%3A38347141+OR+EXT_ID%3A38355974+OR+EXT_ID%3A38367046+OR+EXT_ID%3A38384518+OR+EXT_ID%3A38394646+OR+EXT_ID%3A38414074+OR+EXT_ID%3A38415358+OR+EXT_ID%3A38419085+OR+EXT_ID%3A38428271+OR+EXT_ID%3A38435522+OR+EXT_ID%3A38448475+OR+EXT_ID%3A38460841+OR+EXT_ID%3A38466307+OR+EXT_ID%3A38471502+OR+EXT_ID%3A38475802+OR+EXT_ID%3A38487506+OR+EXT_ID%3A38504017+OR+EXT_ID%3A38504018+OR+EXT_ID%3A38506805+OR+EXT_ID%3A38519519+OR+EXT_ID%3A38519626+OR+EXT_ID%3A38523605+OR+EXT_ID%3A38523679+OR+EXT_ID%3A38528186+OR+EXT_ID%3A38532520+OR+EXT_ID%3A38534493+OR+EXT_ID%3A38539231+OR+EXT_ID%3A38539465+OR+EXT_ID%3A38543226+OR+EXT_ID%3A38553633+OR+EXT_ID%3A38556545+OR+EXT_ID%3A38572754+OR+EXT_ID%3A38580812+OR+EXT_ID%3A38580932+OR+EXT_ID%3A38581113+OR+EXT_ID%3A38582847+OR+EXT_ID%3A38583453+OR+EXT_ID%3A38587017+OR+EXT_ID%3A38597966+OR+EXT_ID%3A38605106+OR+EXT_ID%3A38609507+OR+EXT_ID%3A38613821+OR+EXT_ID%3A38626948+OR+EXT_ID%3A38646652+OR+EXT_ID%3A38654102+OR+EXT_ID%3A38667493+OR+EXT_ID%3A38671759+OR+EXT_ID%3A38689062+OR+EXT_ID%3A38693429+OR+EXT_ID%3A38704465+OR+EXT_ID%3A38720342+OR+EXT_ID%3A38725059+OR+EXT_ID%3A38746668+OR+EXT_ID%3A38763973+OR+EXT_ID%3A38768397+OR+EXT_ID%3A38776130+OR+EXT_ID%3A38778098+OR+EXT_ID%3A38786347%29+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core&pageSize=100", "hitCount": 1, "resultList": {"result": [{"id": "38580932", "source": "MED", "pmid": "38580932", "pmcid": "PMC10998380", "fullTextIdList": {"fullTextId": ["PMC10998380"]}, "doi": "10.1186/s12880-024-01253-0", "title": "A survey of the impact of self-supervised pretraining for diagnostic tasks in medical X-ray, CT, MRI, and ultrasound.", "authorString": "VanBerlo B, Hoey J, Wong A.", "authorList": {"author": [{"fullName": "VanBerlo B", "lastName": "VanBerlo", "firstName": "Blake", "initials": "B", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Cheriton School of Computer Science, 200 University Ave W, N2L 3G1, Waterloo, Canada. bvanberl@uwaterloo.ca."}]}}, {"fullName": "Hoey J", "lastName": "Hoey", "firstName": "Jesse", "initials": "J", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Cheriton School of Computer Science, 200 University Ave W, N2L 3G1, Waterloo, Canada."}]}}, {"fullName": "Wong A", "lastName": "Wong", "firstName": "Alexander", "initials": "A", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Systems Design Engineering, 200 University Ave W, N2L 3G1, Waterloo, Canada."}]}}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "1", "volume": "24", "journalIssueId": 3748724, "dateOfPublication": "2024 Apr", "monthOfPublication": 4, "yearOfPublication": 2024, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "BMC Med Imaging", "title": "BMC medical imaging", "essn": "1471-2342", "issn": "1471-2342", "nlmid": "100968553", "isoabbreviation": "BMC Med Imaging"}, "printPublicationDate": "2024-04-01"}, "pubYear": "2024", "pageInfo": "79", "abstractText": "Self-supervised pretraining has been observed to be effective at improving feature representations for transfer learning, leveraging large amounts of unlabelled data. This review summarizes recent research into its usage in X-ray, computed tomography, magnetic resonance, and ultrasound imaging, concentrating on studies that compare self-supervised pretraining to fully supervised learning for diagnostic tasks such as classification and segmentation. The most pertinent finding is that self-supervised pretraining generally improves downstream task performance compared to full supervision, most prominently when unlabelled examples greatly outnumber labelled examples. Based on the aggregate evidence, recommendations are provided for practitioners considering using self-supervised learning. Motivated by limitations identified in current research, directions and practices for future study are suggested, such as integrating clinical knowledge with theoretically justified self-supervised learning methods, evaluating on public datasets, growing the modest body of evidence for ultrasound, and characterizing the impact of self-supervised pretraining on generalization.", "affiliation": "Cheriton School of Computer Science, 200 University Ave W, N2L 3G1, Waterloo, Canada. bvanberl@uwaterloo.ca.", "publicationStatus": "epublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["review-article", "Review", "Journal Article"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "Natural Sciences and Engineering Research Council of Canada", "grantId": "186945", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Humans"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Tomography, X-Ray Computed"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Magnetic Resonance Imaging"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Radiography"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Ultrasonography"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "X-Rays"}]}, "keywordList": {"keyword": ["X-ray", "ultrasound", "Magnetic Resonance Imaging", "computed tomography", "Radiology", "Machine Learning", "Representation Learning", "Self-supervised Learning"]}, "subsetList": {"subset": [{"code": "IM", "name": "Index Medicus"}]}, "fullTextUrlList": {"fullTextUrl": [{"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Unpaywall", "url": "https://bmcmedimaging.biomedcentral.com/counter/pdf/10.1186/s12880-024-01253-0"}, {"availability": "Subscription required", "availabilityCode": "S", "documentStyle": "doi", "site": "DOI", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1186/s12880-024-01253-0"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "html", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC10998380"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC10998380?pdf=render"}]}, "isOpenAccess": "Y", "inEPMC": "Y", "inPMC": "Y", "citedByCount": 22, "hasReferences": "Y", "hasTextMinedTerms": "Y", "hasDbCrossReferences": "N", "hasPDF": "Y", "hasBook": "N", "hasSuppl": "Y", "hasLabsLinks": "Y", "hasData": "Y", "license": "cc by", "authMan": "N", "epmcAuthMan": "N", "nihAuthMan": "N", "hasTMAccessionNumbers": "Y", "tmAccessionTypeList": {"accessionType": ["doi"]}, "dateOfCompletion": "2024-04-08", "dateOfCreation": "2024-04-05", "dateOfRevision": "2026-07-11", "electronicPublicationDate": "2024-04-06", "firstPublicationDate": "2024-04-06", "firstIndexDate": "2024-04-06", "fullTextReceivedDate": "2025-02-05", "hasEvaluations": "N"}]}}